               PERFORM AUDIT-REG-NUMBER-0002.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-MODEL-0003.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-NCD-YEARS-0004.
               PERFORM FORMAT-VALUE-0005.
               PERFORM CHECK-TERM-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-BEDROOMS-0008.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-SUM-ASSURED-0009.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-WITH-PROFITS-0010.
               PERFORM FORMAT-HOUSE-TYPE-0011.
               PERFORM CHECK-STATUS-CODE-0012.
               PERFORM CHECK-EXCESS-0013.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
